  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialNPC
  indicator: {fileID: 646671462153943881}
  npcName: TutorialGal
  tips:
  - Press WASD to move, Left Shift to run, E to interact with stuff and Left Ctrl
    to Crouch!
  - You can pause the game with the Esc key!
  - In order to shoot you must first aim, that's why you must first press right mouse
    button to aim and then shoot...
  - Change weapons with mouse scroll wheel
  - Remember to take a break here and there or you'll hurt your eyes
